              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತೆಪ್ಪ — teppa — \"a coracle; a raft\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಾವು ತೆಪ್ಪದಲ್ಲಿ ನದಿಯನ್ನು ದಾಟಿದೆವು. nāvu teppadalli nadiyannu dāṭidevu. We crossed the river in a coracle."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A round basket boat, still used for river crossings."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
