          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತೆಪ್ಪ (teppa) is native Dravidian: DEDR 3414 lists Kannada teppa, \"a raft, a float\"."
